    "id" : 29,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 58.917, 175.548, 300.101, 201.272 ],
    "font" : "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "He = Hd + Hrdiag(ϕ)Ht. (1) During the channel training process in the uplink phase, the"
  }, {
