    "font" : "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "to the BS, where xTm ∈ C1×τ,m = 1,2,··· ,Mr is the pilot loaded on the mth antenna at the user. The pilot matrix satisﬁes"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
