    "font" : "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "X 2F = τpu, where pu is the average pilot power. As we consider a time-division duplexing protocol for both uplink as well as downlink transmissions and assume the channel’s reciprocity, the pilot signal received at the BS is given by"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
