    "font" : "CMBX10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Y = HHe X + NBS, (2)"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 36,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 311.997, 706.016, 563.235, 741.91 ],
    "font" : "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "where NBS ∈ CMt×τ denotes the noise matrix at the BS with an average noise power of σBS2 , whose ith column vector follows nBS,i ∼ CN 0M"
  }, {
