    "font" : "NimbusRomNo9L-Regu",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Next, we consider the downlink of data transmission where the BS applies a baseband precoder W ∈ CMt×Ms to transmit symbol s ∈ CMs×1, with E ssH = IM"
  }, {
